  "theorem_statement": "Eight dimensionless Standard Model observables are now within 1 sigma of their PDG 2024 values via W(3,3) integer-ratio closed forms (Koide, sin^2 theta_W via RG, lambda_H via MSbar, four Wolfenstein parameters, and the top Yukawa cubed).  Together with a single dimensional anchor v_EW = 246.21965 GeV, two of these closures yield dimensional predictions m_H = 125.55 GeV (within 0.3% of PDG) and m_t = 172.68 GeV (within 0.05 sigma of PDG).  The dimensionful scale map for the lighter-fermion sector and the M_Pl / v hierarchy remains open.",
